  "guide_accounting_accounts": "Here, you can select the different accounts to which the amount should be allocated.",
  "guide_accounting_amount": "Provide the respective amount here.",
  "guide_accounting_bookings": "Here, you can view the recorded bookings.",
  "guide_accounting_proceed": "Click here to proceed further once you have completed the accounting.",
  "guide_accounting_save": "Press this button to save the changes you made in the accounting section.",
  "guide_accounting_setup": "Press this button to verify if everything is configured correctly.",
  "guide_accounting_training_data": "Press this button to open a menu for training, testing, and deleting models for auto accounting.",
  "guide_accounting_training_data_test": "Click 'Test Data', then click 'Test' to evaluate how well the system is currently performing.",
  "guide_accounting_training_data_train": "Click 'Train Data', select an account, and then click 'Train' to teach the system how to handle that specific case based on your input for future use.",
  "guide_accounting_unsettled_amount": "Here, you can view how much of the amount is unsettled.",
  "guide_accounting_video": "<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JZJfSkB8nJA?si=wFjZhq_HwORe_OIs\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>",
  "guide_accounting_voucher": "Here, you can enter a voucher text if desired.",
  "guide_accounting_zoom": "Here you can adjust the display size of the document. Use the plus and minus buttons to increase or decrease the size.",
  "guide_actions": "Actions: In this section, you have several options available, including validating the document, assigning it, viewing the document flow, downloading or restarting the document, viewing logs for both the document and its workflow, or deleting the document. To access these options for a specific document, click the three-dot menu on the right.",
  "guide_actions_2": "<p>The action bar includes helpful icons. Hover over the available icons to view more information about their functions.\nNote: Some icons depend on system settings and may not be active by default.</p>\n<img src=\"images/guide_dashbaord_2.png\" height=\"100\" width=\"auto\"  alt=\"guide_dashbaord_2.png\" />",
  "guide_actions_3": "<p>If you are using PO Matching, click this icon to be redirected directly to the PO Matching screen for the corresponding document in that row..</p>\n<img src=\"images/po_not_matched.svg\" height=\"100\" width=\"auto\"  alt=\"po_icon\" />",
  "guide_actions_4": "<p>If you are using Duplicate Detection, click this icon to display any detected duplicates. For more information, see this section. For more information go to: <a href=\"https://docs.docbits.com/administration-and-setup/settings/global-settings/document-types/more-settings/duplicate-document-handling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">docs.docbits.com</a></p>\n<img src=\"images/duplicateInvoiceIcon.svg\" height=\"100\" width=\"auto\"  alt=\"duplicateIcon\" />",
  "guide_activity_stream": "Click here to open the Activity Stream, where you can post and read comments from other users. If available, you can also view the approval history in this section.",
  "guide_add_rules": "For Administrators: Click here to add custom rules or Python scripts to modify how the document is processed. More information can be found here: <a href=\"https://docs.docbits.com/advanced-functions-and-tools/scripting-in-docbits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">docs.docbits.com</a>",
  "guide_advanced_dashboard_section": "Click here to access the Advanced Shipment Dashboard. For more information go to:\n<a href=\"https://docs.docbits.com/end-user-and-partner-section/end-user-section/advance-shipment-dashboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">docs.docbits.com</a>",
  "guide_annotate_document": "Select an area to annotate the document. A menu will appear with options to write, save, or delete the annotation.",
  "guide_annotate_document_text": "Click here to switch back to text-based annotation.",
  "guide_annotate_document_text_tinted": "Click one of the tinted letters to annotate the document directly in the selected color.",
  "guide_annotate_stamp": "Click here to have the option to add an 'Approved' or 'Rejected' stamp to the document. Select the stamp on the bottom right, then click 'Add'.",
  "guide_approval_details": "In this section, you will find all relevant details for the approval process.",
  "guide_approval_level": "Here you can see whether the document is at the first or second level of approval.",
  "guide_approval_queue": "Here you can see how many documents are currently in the approval queue.",
  "guide_approval_table": "In this section, you will find multiple tables containing various information to verify data validity before approval.",
  "guide_approve": "Click here to approve the document.",
  "guide_auto_export": "Activate this feature to automatically export documents when they match 100%.",
  "guide_auto_po_match": "Press this button to automatically match the PO lines.",
  "guide_back": "Back",
  "guide_back_dashboard": "Click here to be redirected to the dashboard. Please be aware that any unsaved changes will be lost.",
  "guide_back_validation": "Click here to be redirected to the validation screen. Please be aware that any unsaved changes will be lost.",
  "guide_back_validation_save": "Click here to be redirected to the validation screen. Any changes you’ve made will be saved automatically.",
  "guide_conformation": "<p>When you click an input field, a highlighted box will appear on the document, allowing you to verify if the extracted value is correct.</p>\n<img src=\"images/guide_validation_3.png\" height=\"100\" width=\"auto\"  alt=\"guide_validation_3\" />",
