  "guide_conformation_button_3": "<p>Click the trashcan icon to remove the connection and delete the training data.</p>\n<img src=\"images/guide_validation_3.png\" height=\"100\" width=\"auto\"  alt=\"guide_validation_3\" />",
  "guide_conformation_buttons": "<p>You have three options for handling the extracted value:</p>\n<img src=\"images/guide_validation_3.png\" height=\"100\" width=\"auto\"  alt=\"guide_validation_3\" />",
