      "help_sidebar": {
        "company_info": "Company Information",
        "company_info_desc": "Configure essential company details including company name, address, postal code, city, country, company ID, tax ID, commercial register ID, phone number, and email. This information ensures accurate company representation in documents, official communications, and system integrations, supporting legal and financial documentation requirements.",
        "company_info_short": "Manage company details, contact information, and legal identifiers",
        "company_info_tip": "Always use official registered company information for legal compliance. This data appears in invoices, official documents, and system-wide communications. Verify all details before saving.",
        "learn_more": "Learn more →",
        "preferences": "Company Preferences",
        "preferences_desc": "Configure application-wide settings: Date Pattern (choose display format using placeholders like %d/%m/%Y), Amount Formatting (select decimal and thousands separators for regional formats like 1,000.00 or 1.000,00), and New Version Info Dialog (enable popup notifications for application updates). These preferences standardize document processing and user experience across your organization.",
