        "theme_desc": "Customize your DocBits interface color scheme to distinguish between environments (production, testing, sandbox). Select colors via color picker or hex code input. Best practices: use neutral colors for production (white, light grey), bright colors for testing (yellow, orange), and distinct colors for sandbox (blue, grey). This helps users quickly recognize which environment they're working in.",
