  "touchless_method_buckets_title": "What each outcome means",
  "touchless_method_denominator_body": "Only documents that reached a final state count. Documents still being processed are excluded — they have no outcome yet, and counting them would drag every rate towards zero for reasons that have nothing to do with automation.",
  "touchless_method_denominator_title": "What the rate is measured over",
  "touchless_method_freshness_body": "Outcomes are recalculated every 15 minutes. ERP confirmations can arrive hours after export, so a document's final outcome may change after it first appears here. The timestamp under the report states what it was last computed from.",
  "touchless_method_freshness_title": "How current these numbers are",
  "touchless_method_in_progress": "Not finished yet. Counted in no rate — it has no outcome to report.",
  "touchless_method_not_eligible": "Deliberately outside the measurement: deleted, a test fixture, or an excluded document type.",
  "touchless_method_process_exception": "Ended in an error, was rejected, or was refused by the ERP.",
